!include ../_style.puml

title LINE對話範圍狀態機圖

[*] --> unbound : initialize [no lineUserId] / await bind
unbound --> token_issued : createBindToken / save one-time token with expiry
token_issued --> unbound : bindMessage [invalid or expired] / delete expired token
token_issued --> idle : bindMessage [signature and token valid] / bind lineUserId and delete token
idle --> awaiting_course_selection : requestCourseList [multiple valid courses] / show options
idle --> course_selected : selectDirect [one valid course] / set activeCourseId
awaiting_course_selection --> course_selected : postback [active enrollment and published] / set activeCourseId
awaiting_course_selection --> idle : postback [scope invalid] / clear pending selection
course_selected --> course_selected : ask [scope still valid] / reuse shared QA service
course_selected --> idle : enrollmentRevoked / clear activeCourseId and history
idle --> unbound : unbind / clear lineUserId and course scope
course_selected --> unbound : unbind / clear lineUserId and course scope

note right of course_selected
  對應設計類別：User LINE conversation scope。
  webhook 事件須先通過 HMAC-SHA256 簽章驗證。
end note

@enduml
